flowchart LR
    P[synthetic phase + messages] --> V{simulated policy valid?}
    V -- no --> R[refuse before dispatch]
    V -- yes --> E[illustrative cost projection]
    E --> G{known estimates + projected within cap?}
    G -- no or unknown --> R
    G -- yes --> C[one configured client]
    C --> U[reported usage + client latency]
    U --> L[known estimate or unknown accounting]
    L --> S[stop later calls on budget overrun]
